---
description: Polish full female name — a single given name and a single surname (Anna Nowak). Polish names carry one surname, unlike the two-surname Spanish form. The surname comes from the feminine list, so adjectival surnames read -ska / -cka as Polish requires.
generator: tdc
locale: pl
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="pl.person.female.firstName"/>
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="pl.person.female.lastName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.f}} ${{p.l}}</data>
